      "writtenOn": "2024-02-29T21:00:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "a static structure can not be dynamic (i.e. reference counted), that\u0027s not what reference counts are for.  This must be dynamic to work properly.\n\nThis should dictate the lifespan of the object being used, not the code itself (which is what I think this is attempting to reference count, if not, I\u0027m confused.)",
